
.TH Include_functor_desugared 3 "" "Odoc" "OCaml Library"
.SH Name
Oxcaml\.Include_functor_desugared
.SH Synopsis
.sp 
.in 2
\fBModule Oxcaml\.Include_functor_desugared\fR
.in 
.sp 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]module\fR Make (T : \f[CB]sig\fR \.\.\. \f[CB]end\fR) : \f[CB]sig\fR \.\.\. \f[CB]end\fR
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
This module is the desugared version of \f[CI]Include_functor\fR: the synthetic module aliases the preceding items rather than copying them, so that the types the functor inherits from its argument resolve back to them\.
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR t
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR included = t
